  "Scope": "Extend the existing bounded Dot-repeat helper only when a complete \u003C=64-byte unfolded ASCII tail ends at Accept/Jump-to-Accept; select the last valid scalar endpoint, then execute original capture/tail instructions. Strict validation and per-scalar work/token/deadline remain; no new matcher/program/field/mode. Twelve equal-result public Count workloads: actual Holmes ordinary/compiled/finite-live/deadline-live, shared River, scalar dense hits/false tails; unchanged ASCII-native, captured-tail, captured/folded literal-repeat and exact-literal controls. Finite work1B/depth4096/working16MiB/result16MiB; deadline5s. Warm1s/min64, independent60ms calibration, five alternating samples\u003E=20ms, consume batches after timing. One120s cap, at most one noise confirmation. No package/fullcatalog qualification.",
